WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:03.080 --> 00:08.620
Like most of us, your life has probably changed dramatically
in the last few years.

2
00:08.680 --> 00:16.220
Every day you rely on digital devices, technologies, and services
that didn't exist just a few years ago.

3
00:16.280 --> 00:18.780
The way we work has changed too.

4
00:18.840 --> 00:23.740
The most successful organizations today are highly digital, nimble,

5
00:23.800 --> 00:30.940
relentlessly finding new ways to create value
for customers and consumers, employees, and broader society.

6
00:31.160 --> 00:33.900
What's the secret to their success?

7
00:34.200 --> 00:36.140
It's not just technology.

8
00:36.280 --> 00:43.900
It's the people who find new ways to use technology,
collect and analyze data, and collaborate with others.

9
00:43.960 --> 00:49.585
Right now, farmers are growing more food
and feeding more people because of digital.

10
00:50.045 --> 00:55.985
Large companies are perfecting complex systems
in supply chain, manufacturing and distribution,

11
00:56.045 --> 01:00.145
to produce and deliver goods on a scale never before achieved.

12
01:00.285 --> 01:07.505
Medical teams are finding more efficient ways to distribute
life-saving medicine and vaccines to hard-to-reach patients.

13
01:07.805 --> 01:13.105
Design teams are inventing products and services
that will one day seem indispensable.

14
01:13.965 --> 01:22.945
All of this is possible because of the people who saw a problem
and used data, technology, and new ways of working to solve it.

15
01:23.005 --> 01:25.940
We can achieve new levels of success as well.

16
01:26.000 --> 01:30.980
You, as an individual, play a pivotal role in forging our future.

17
01:31.040 --> 01:36.580
Digital is bringing a future that will allow you
to better connect and collaborate with other people.

18
01:36.640 --> 01:43.220
Changes in technology will allow you to focus
on the most inspiring and creative parts of your job.

19
01:43.280 --> 01:49.620
New methods of collecting and analyzing data
will allow you to make faster and more accurate decisions.

20
01:49.840 --> 01:58.500
New team structures and ways of working will allow you to innovate
and get more done with less effort, extending your reach and impact.

21
01:58.640 --> 02:00.980
How will this future come about?

22
02:01.040 --> 02:03.735
We are all inventing it. Together.

23
02:03.795 --> 02:12.295
We make the future happen as we apply new technology, data, and ways of working
to better serve the people who rely on us.

24
02:12.355 --> 02:15.975
We each contribute to our collective success if we stay curious,

25
02:16.035 --> 02:22.075
take opportunities to learn new skills,
and if we continually seek new possibilities.
